'''Le'noir''' (松 黒蔵, ''Matsu Kurozō'') is a [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]] variant of [[Le'boin]] that appears in [[The Aku Realms]], [[Into the Future]] and [[Legend Stages]]. He was added in [[Version 3.5 Update|Version 3.5]].

